cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you refer to this script collection, please cite it using the
  Zenodo concept DOI below. This identifier represents all archived
  versions and resolves to the latest archived release.
type: software
title: "Phyto-MAP data-processing scripts"
authors:
  - family-names: "Rayón Viña"
    given-names: "Fernando"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1622-2180"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23219719"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RayonVina/phytomap-code"
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23219719"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Edited and standardised scripts documenting source-specific data
  processing, taxonomic curation and relational database construction
  during the development of Phyto-MAP. The collection documents the
  retained programmatic components, not a complete executable history
  of every change made to the data.
keywords:
  - Phyto-MAP
  - marine phytoplankton
  - abundance
  - data curation
  - taxonomy
  - R
  - SQLite
